+# Wire serialisation format
+
+The project's most recent recorded statement on the wire serialisation format is CBOR (Concise Binary Object Representation). This comes from a direct instruction given during project work, not from a formally ratified decision, and no further rationale or specifics (schema conventions, versioning, scope) have been recorded. Until a later decision says otherwise, CBOR is the format to use.
